WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.320
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I’m&nbsp;
going to explain a science fiction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.560
film called “D0wnsizing.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:18.080
The movie begins in Edvardsen Institute,&nbsp;
Norway. A group of scientists are researching&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.560
a procedure of some sort. We see Dr.&nbsp;
Jorgen and his colleague, Andreas,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.040
excitedly talk about an experiment that has&nbsp;
been successful. The two hug in excitement. 
&nbsp;

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.880
Cut to five years later. Andreas is presenting&nbsp;
their study to an auditorium full of people in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:38.160
a Convention centre in Italy. He has a box with&nbsp;
himself that he carefully sits on the podium.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.840
He then gives the audience a speech about&nbsp;
the negative effects of global warming and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:46.640
scarcity of food and water it causes. He goes&nbsp;
on to explain that their project will not just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:50.880
reduce global warming, but also solve the&nbsp;
problem of scarcity of natural supplies. 
&nbsp;

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:56.400
He says that this is the only practical and&nbsp;
humane remedy to mankind’s gravest problem.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.800
He then proceeds to reveal what is inside&nbsp;
the box. The audience gasps when they see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:06.000
a tiny Dr. Jorgen in the box. He looks like&nbsp;
any normal human being, but smaller in size.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:12.240
No one can believe their eyes. They stand up to&nbsp;
get a better view of Dr. Jorgen. Dr. Jorgen asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:17.680
everyone to take a seat. A tiny microphone stands&nbsp;
in front of him and he starts speaking. He says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:22.560
that five years ago, he and his team developed&nbsp;
a procedure that reduces all organic material&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:29.760
to cellular level by a ratio of 2744 to 1. Using&nbsp;
this process, Dr. Jorgen had turned miniscule. 
&nbsp;

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:33.760
The procedure was tested on a&nbsp;
large number of plants and animals,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.840
and they have found out that the procedure is&nbsp;
irreversible, but has no side effects at all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:42.960
Thirty six volunteers joined Dr. Jorgen’s team,&nbsp;
and they have been living life as a small person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:48.000
ever since. The procedure only requires the&nbsp;
removal of dental and other prosthetics.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.080
The person fully recovers after an&nbsp;
hour or two after being turned small.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:56.240
They then bring out the thirty six volunteers&nbsp;
of the project, who are now small people.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.920
They have lived in the world’s first&nbsp;
small colony for the past four years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:05.440
They have also birthed a little baby. 
The audience clapped in admiration. This is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:11.120
the biggest discovery in history. The concept of&nbsp;
downsizing is now introduced. People from around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:15.440
the world watch the television in shock as they&nbsp;
broadcast attractive advertisements about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:20.080
discovery. They encourage everyone to go miniscule&nbsp;
to save the planet and for a better life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:26.000
Paul Safranek is one of the viewers. He watches&nbsp;
the advertisement in awe. He goes home to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.440
sick mother; she is the only person in Paul’s&nbsp;
life. She complains about the downsizing program,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.720
saying that the same energy must be put&nbsp;
into finding the cure of her illness. 

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:40.880
It is now ten years later, Paul's mother has&nbsp;
long passed on. Paul now works as an occupational&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:46.080
therapist and is married to his wife, Audrey&nbsp;
Safranek. The couple is struggling financially.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:50.240
The two have to relocate to a new home&nbsp;
because of their financial problems.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.480
Meanwhile, the downsizing program has become&nbsp;
more and more popular through the years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.920
Several miniscule colonies have been&nbsp;
established throughout the world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:02.400
3% of the world has gone through downsizing&nbsp;
and currently lives in those colonies. 
&nbsp;

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:08.800
One day, the Safraneks go to their highschool&nbsp;
reunion. There, they meet their old friends, Dave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:14.000
and Carol Johnson, who have downsized. After the&nbsp;
reunion, they gather at a friend’s house where The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.560
Johnsons boast about it being the best decision&nbsp;
they have ever made in their life. They now live&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:23.520
in a miniscule colony in New Mexico called the&nbsp;
Leisureland. When Paul praises Dave for doing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:28.640
so much for the environment, Dave reveals that&nbsp;
he only did it for the money. After downsizing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:35.200
expenses drop by 90%. Dave used to be broke in&nbsp;
Vegas, before they decided to downsize. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:39.280
the two are going on a six months trip to Italy&nbsp;
and living their best life in a huge mansion. 
&nbsp;

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.680
Interested in the miniature life, the&nbsp;
following day, Paul and Audrey go to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:49.040
a Leisureland convention. There, a downsized man&nbsp;
explains to them the benefits of being downsized.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:53.680
He shows them the house of his dreams right&nbsp;
in front of him. The miniature house opens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:58.880
to reveal a luxurious interior. A woman is inside&nbsp;
the house who boasts about her diamond jewellery&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:03.680
that cost her only eighty three dollars. Paul&nbsp;
and Audrey are fascinated by the luxurious life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:08.080
of the miniatures. They then go to a viewing&nbsp;
area, where they look over the Leisureland.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.480
The colony is covered with nets to keep&nbsp;
away mosquitos and harmful UV rays. 
&nbsp;

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.240
The couple watch in awe and decide&nbsp;
that they too will downsize.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.600
They meet an agent who tells them that in&nbsp;
Leisureland, their 152 thousand dollars is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:26.960
12 million dollars to live on. Paul and Audrey&nbsp;
are stunned. Later, we see them selling their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:31.920
belongings in a yard sale, so that they can sell&nbsp;
everything and live as miniatures. Later that day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.160
they meet at a pub where their friends and&nbsp;
family wish them goodbye. Later that night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:40.000
the two keep their rings in a box to be brought&nbsp;
to their miniature house when they relocate. 
&nbsp;

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:45.120
The following day, they drive to the Leisureland&nbsp;
convention where they will undergo downsizing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.400
However, Audrey seems to be&nbsp;
doubtful of the decision. 
&nbsp;

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:54.560
The two are separated in the waiting room. Paul&nbsp;
is taken for the procedure before Audrey. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:59.440
told that they will meet after the procedure, when&nbsp;
they are already downsized. At the beginning of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:04.720
the procedure, they shave Paul’s head and eyebrows&nbsp;
off as those cannot be downsized. Then they change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:09.600
him into hospital gowns, and sedate him to trim&nbsp;
all the hair on his body. They do the same to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:14.720
several other men beside Paul. Since downsizing&nbsp;
cannot be performed with dental prosthetics,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:19.040
they perform a dental surgery on everyone and&nbsp;
remove the prosthetic teeths. They are then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:23.840
taken to the incubation hall where the downsizers&nbsp;
are kept naked. The doors to the hall close. 
&nbsp;

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:28.400
After some time, it opens and we see&nbsp;
everyone inside has been downsized.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:34.080
Now, they are scooped up gently with a spatula&nbsp;
and put into miniature beds. Then, they are handed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:39.040
down to small nurses from the Leisureland. Their&nbsp;
dental prosthetics are put back into their cavity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:44.160
Finally, the procedure is done and the&nbsp;
newly downsized people are sent to rest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:49.600
When Paul wakes up, he is alone in the waiting&nbsp;
room. A nurse greets him. She also gives him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:54.640
a huge cracker as a gift. He asks for Audrey’s&nbsp;
whereabouts, so the nurse goes to look for her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:59.520
She comes in with a phone some time&nbsp;
later. Audrey speaks from the other end.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:03.840
She frantically tells Paul that they shaved&nbsp;
her head and eyebrows. Then we see a bald&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:08.800
Audrey with only one eyebrow at the airport. 
Paul is shocked as it turns out that Audrey ran&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:14.160
away as they started shaving her eyebrows; she has&nbsp;
decided to not downsize at the very last moment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:19.360
The two yell at each other through the phone.&nbsp;
Paul is now alone in the new city of miniatures.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:22.560
He is guided to his luxury mansion but&nbsp;
he now has to live there alone. 
&nbsp;

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:28.240
It is now a year later. Paul has divorced&nbsp;
Audrey and settled into a new apartment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:32.640
He had anticipated an easy life but the divorce&nbsp;
settlement took away half of his assets.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:38.160
He currently works in a call centre and is dating&nbsp;
a girl named Kristen. One night, they are in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:42.720
Paul’s room having dinner when Paul’s upstairs&nbsp;
neighbor, Dusan, comes in to inform him that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:47.840
is holding a party. Later, Kristen and Paul break&nbsp;
up, prompting him to attend Dusan’s party.
&nbsp;

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:53.600
Paul has the time of his life. He kisses&nbsp;
a random girl and accepts a pill from her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:57.520
The drug starts to take Paul over,&nbsp;
and he enjoys himself the whole night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:02.640
The following morning, he wakes up under a table&nbsp;
at Dusan’s apartment. The cleaning workers arrive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:07.360
One of the workers who limps, catches Paul’s&nbsp;
eyes since he is an occupational therapist.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:13.200
He asks her to sit down ,and helps her with her&nbsp;
prosthetic legs. Paul recognizes the worker as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:17.920
Ngoc Lan Tran, a Vietnamese political activist&nbsp;
who was jailed and downsized against her will.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:22.560
Ngoc Lan’s story was broadcasted worldwide&nbsp;
then, but eventually it died down.
&nbsp;

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:27.200
Ngoc Lan takes Paul to her neighborhood to&nbsp;
check on people there, even though he is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:32.320
physical therapist and not a doctor. Paul sees&nbsp;
that the place she lives is in extreme poverty,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:37.440
even though they are miniatures. There, Paul helps&nbsp;
Ngoc Lan with her prosthetic leg but accidentally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:42.240
breaks it. As a result of his screw-up, Ngoc&nbsp;
Lan makes him do her cleaning job until her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:47.680
new prosthetic legs arrive. Paul goes to work with&nbsp;
Ngoc Lan everyday and does the cleaning for her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:51.760
They collect the leftover food from the people&nbsp;
they work for, and bring it back to Ngoc Lan’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:56.720
community to distribute it between the poors.&nbsp;
Paul sees the good in Ngoc Lan. Even though she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:00.160
is suffering herself, she doesn’t forget&nbsp;
to help other people in her community.
&nbsp;

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:05.680
One day, Ngoc Lan gets a cleaning job at&nbsp;
Dusan’s. Dusan is surprised to see Paul&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:09.760
working as a cleaner, and makes fun of&nbsp;
him. Paul informs him that he has to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:14.400
this for next six weeks to a month. Seeing his&nbsp;
friend suffer, Dusan decides to help him.
&nbsp;

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:20.400
He offers Paul a chance to get away by joining him&nbsp;
and his friend, Joris Konrad, in going to Norway,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:25.680
where the first small community was created.&nbsp;
However, Ngoc Lan insists that she wants to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:30.800
too, because she was called by the Doctor who&nbsp;
started this all, Dr. Jorgen. The doctor too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:35.600
lives in the same colony, and wanted to meet Ngoc&nbsp;
Lan because of her heroic protests in Vietnam. 
&nbsp;

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:39.840
The boys almost do not believe her,&nbsp;
but they eventually leave for Norway.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:44.640
Cut to a few days later, all of them are&nbsp;
travelling in a fjord in Dusan's yacht.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:48.800
They suddenly encounter Dr. Jorgen and his wife&nbsp;
in their own yacht going to the colony as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:54.560
Ngoc Lan finally meets Dr. Jorgen, who apologizes&nbsp;
to her because his procedure was used wrongfully&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:59.600
on her. There, the group is informed about the&nbsp;
methane release in Antarctica that will increase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:05.120
global warming by a vast percentage. This cannot&nbsp;
be stopped, and because of mass overpopulation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:10.000
the human race will eventually become extinct&nbsp;
in one hundred years. The downsizing was made to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:15.760
reduce the possibility to some extent, but only&nbsp;
3% of the whole world is downsized. Dr. Jorgen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:20.480
is devastated that his creation was too late to&nbsp;
save the world. The damage is irreversible. 
&nbsp;

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:26.800
Later, Ngoc Lan and Paul are together in her&nbsp;
cabin. Paul checks her legs. One thing leads&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:31.680
to another, and they end up having sex. 
The following morning, they finally reach the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:37.200
first colony. It is a tiny village where people&nbsp;
live in harmony. They are welcomed wholeheartedly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:42.080
There, the villagers have created a large vault&nbsp;
inside a mountain to insulate the colony and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:47.200
preserve humanity in the event of an extinction.&nbsp;
The whole village, along with Dr. Jorgen and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:52.400
wife, plan to go inside the vault the following&nbsp;
day. Inspired by Dr. Jorgen’s words, Paul too&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:58.000
wants to go with the colony. He feels as though he&nbsp;
was brought there for a reason. So, when Ngoc asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:02.720
him to come back with her, he denies. Dusan and&nbsp;
Joris too are returning back to their home. 
&nbsp;

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:08.160
It is now the following day; a few hours&nbsp;
before everyone migrates to the vault.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:12.560
Ngoc asks Paul if he had sex with her because&nbsp;
he pities her. Paul replies that he really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:17.120
cares about her, but the vault gives his&nbsp;
life a purpose. The time finally comes;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:20.880
Paul says his farewell and goes into the&nbsp;
vault while the other three stand outside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:26.400
However, Paul changes his mind midway, he&nbsp;
likes Ngoc too much to leave for the vault.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:30.160
He comes back and hugs her. Soon,&nbsp;
the vault’s door closes forever. 
&nbsp;

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.640
The four of them return to Leisureland.&nbsp;
Back there, Ngoc and Paul live their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:38.320
lives together while helping the people&nbsp;
of Ngoc’s community, living in slums. 
